OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few bright spells across the
OL,6,Fsoutheast. Otherwise rather cloudy
OL,7,Fwith a few showers, these most
OL,8,Ffrequent across the north and west.
OL,9,FDrier across the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be cloudy
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain. Then the rest
OL,13,Fof the night will be cloudy with
OL,14,Ffurther spells of rain, perhaps heavy
OL,15,Fin the southeast later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA cloudy day with further
OL,18,Fspells of rain, perhaps some warm
OL,19,Fsunshine breaking through across the
OL,20,Fsoutheast at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
