OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Ffor most of Thursday but rain
OL,7,Fspreading east later. Mainly dry and
OL,8,Fbright on Friday and Saturday, perhaps
OL,9,Fsome further rain later on Saturday.
